error[NK2108]: `check` can fail, and `c.names` is out of `c`, the view of `m[…]`, at that point.
   --> tests/a_failing_call_while_a_views_part_is_out_is_refused.nika:23:13
    |
 22 |     let kept = keep(c.names)
    |                     ------- taken out of `c` here
 23 |     let n = check(kept.len())
    |             ^^^^^ can fail while the part is out
